  "summary": "古赋武曲加吉坐迁移称巨商高贾，作者限定武曲旺宫、多吉且从商才有致富机会，不能由命格断必经商。迁移宫象征对外活动与遭遇，旺吉较顺、弱凶较坎坷。祿權、吉星组等原称保留，不把不明禄断为化禄或禄存。",
  "summary_en": "The verse links Military Melody with favorable support in Travel to prosperous commerce. The author qualifies this: strong placement, many benefics and actual commercial work provide an opportunity, not certainty of wealth or a guaranteed business career. Travel symbolizes outward activity and life experiences; strong favorable conditions support smoother dealings, whereas weak adverse conditions suggest difficulty. Lu Quan and abbreviated benefic groups remain source expressions; ambiguous Lu is not forced into Prosperity Transformation or Salary Star.",
